#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Vnum exemplar faciei ascriptum est. Lucernae mutationes quomodo vultus ad "
"cameram spectat, ut unum exemplar in vespere sub lucernis (vel in luce) "
"deficiat. Adde alterum exemplar in diversis lucis commemoratis ut certos "
"aliquo tempore diei reserans custodiat."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Addere alterum exemplar"

