"Intimatio desktop ostendit dum vultus vultus tui UH⟧, tunc eventum refert. "
"Defecit conatus manere in notitia album."

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Ostende notificationes"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
