"chartae. Utilis quaestio referrentur."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KW⟧ Auto- Basem"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Admitte faciem authenticas ut sponte aperias aperiens conventum tuum keyring "
"vel KW⟧ in login. Hoc secure tesseram tuam obsignatam in TPM cum promptu "
"reponit, aut cum AES impressis utens clavem domini soli radix. Facies auth "
"ponit PAM⟧ pro PGK⟧ vel PKW⟧ pendens in escritorio tuo."

#: src/main.ui:652
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Current Status:"

#: src/main.ui:661
